;    1: TDecorate(count=97, unk2=11195903, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しゃば, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=22, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=やまがき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しっせき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ささや, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=24, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=21, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=21, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=けんそう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だんらん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あわ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=11195903, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=やまがき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひきょう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=さんさん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=6168, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5526, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>―Judgment. <STYLE ID="1">Akane Kogori</STYLE> is hereby sentenced to life imprisonment.
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\共有殺人.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\裁判所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From this moment, a new step in my life begins.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Despair, or hope―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That goes without saying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one could possibly call it hope.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm no exception.<PG>
When it comes to life imprisonment, can you imagine how long it takes before you get out?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The longest fixed-term sentence is 30 years, so you'd think about the same, 30 years at most?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Naive―not getting out even after 50 years is normal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Life imprisonment is, in practice, imprisonment until you die.<PG>
Even supposing I could get out while I'm still alive, it would no longer be the society I know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd be an aged Urashima Taro, a doddering, brutal old woman thrown out into a world she knows nothing about.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―April, Shiyo 815.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sawa Prison, in Minakami City, Sawa Prefecture.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\独房.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Wake-up is fixed at 6:30 on workdays, 7:30 on rest days.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After nearly 15 years of the same life, my body wakes up on its own before the guard comes to wake me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without exception, up at 6:30 or 7:30, and lights-out at 9 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't need a clock anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My body clock can tell me what time it is.<PG>
Without my thinking about anything, roll call and cell inspection are over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've gone through them every day without fail.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So today, too, I would get through roll call and cell inspection in a daze.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or so I'd intended―
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Number 204</STYLE>, move out!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One morning, a guard shouted that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Move out?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was I going into another solitary cell? Or into a shared cell, with a group?<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I like this solitary cell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a shared cell, everyone would pry into my past, just out of curiosity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hear that I'm the one who actually did the Megasawa City case, and they're bound to be curious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyone who takes an interest in me, a few years short of 60, is a peculiar sort indeed.<PG>
Normally, inmates go into a shared cell, but anyone who finds group living difficult for some reason is put in a solitary cell like this one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my case, as the one who actually did the Megasawa City case, even the other inmates look at me with curious eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That can start trouble, or get you judged unfit for group activity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps they foresaw that, because I've been kept in solitary from the very beginning.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\手錠.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I was handcuffed and taken out of my solitary cell.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\歩く響く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\刑務所廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No, but this is strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally, you don't get handcuffed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The last time I was handcuffed was the day I was brought to this prison.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside a prison, you almost never get handcuffed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\屋上ドア前半.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Up the stairs, through several sets of bars―
{PAUSE ""}
we were clearly heading somewhere other than the cell blocks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be an execution, out of nowhere?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, that's not so bad either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not that I'd particularly mind if a life like this ended right now. Not particularly...<PG>
But once even the faintest possibility of execution surfaced, I grew very anxious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd thought a life like this was as good as dead, yet when it came to actually dying, a sudden clinging to life welled up in me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely not an execution, out of nowhere...<PG>
I was sentenced to life imprisonment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I won't die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So calm down, me...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\すずめ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\護送車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Dazzling spring sunlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What appeared in front of me was a bus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a large prison bus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd probably be put on it, but would other inmates be riding along too?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\護送車内部.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I was pushed inside with no say in the matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
Once several prison officers and several inmates had boarded, the bus slowly started to move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where did they mean to take me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Curtains were drawn over the windows, and the driver's side was shut off by a windowless door, so I couldn't even see the windshield.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\護送車車窓.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Through a gap in the curtains, I could see outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しゃば">outside world</STYLE>, seen with my own eyes for the first time in ages.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A world I would probably never set foot in again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I should fix it in my memory while I can.<PG>
...But I soon got tired of that, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been cut off from the world for 15 years, but nothing in particular had changed much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The utility poles, the buildings, the cars, the clothes people wore, all were just as they'd been.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\護送車内部.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I turned my eyes back to the inside of the bus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Around me were only female officers and inmates.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Naturally, since where I'd been was a women's prison.<PG>
If they were moving several inmates, was this a transfer to another prison?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I might get scolded, but... I wanted to make sure.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I spoke up quietly, the young officer nearest me turned her face slightly toward me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Where are we going now...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, the young officer glanced restlessly around, as if reading the faces of the others.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Checking whether it was all right to answer, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the other officers showed no reaction at all.<PG>
"You're being transferred from Sawa Prison to the newly built Motoki Prison."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Motoki Prison...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes. With Motoki City's population growing, all kinds of facilities are being built. 
{PAUSE ""}
The prison is one of them. <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-san</STYLE>, your family is in Motoki-cho, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, that's right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So―"<PG>
When the young officer had gotten that far, another officer spoke up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san, that's enough."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, sorry..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The young officer called <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE> was <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しっせき">reprimanded</STYLE>, and she closed her mouth and hung her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. So she's <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san, the rookie.<PG>
Then <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san whispered under her breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Starting today I'm posted to Motoki Prison. I look forward to working with you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one but me seemed to have noticed her <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ささや">whisper</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How many years had it been since anyone spoke such kind words to me?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\護送車車窓.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now and then <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> came to visit, but apart from <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>, there'd been no one who treated me the way <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san did.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But before long, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san would learn to carry herself as a prison officer, and stop treating me like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, not that I mean to find hope in something this small.<PG>
Even so...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motoki-cho, huh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fifteen years on, and I'm setting foot in Motoki-cho again―
{PAUSE ""}
no, in Motoki City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems it's now a regional city with a population of over 150,000.<PG>
Just being able to go back to a place like that makes me feel a little happy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though since I can't see out from inside the walls, it's still a treat I'm made to wait for...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> ought to come see me more often than before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That alone is my pleasure, and my comfort.<PG>
What has become of <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My other daughter. There's no way I wouldn't worry about her, and no way I could forget her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\人質カラー2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'm told that on that day, <STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu</STYLE> took <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and vanished somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have used Droga. She jumped from the apartment building and was gone in the blink of an eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, maybe, she headed straight for the Arata settlement.<PG>
No one has ever told me where <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE> went.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What became of <STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu</STYLE> never reaches my ears either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, probably no one knows.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The bus began to slow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The road swung in a wide curve, and then we gradually picked up speed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed we'd gotten onto the expressway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the roads and the speed limits were the same as 15 years ago, we'd arrive in about an hour.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I think I'll close my eyes for a bit. Right now, surely, even dozing off is allowed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAITPLAY "BGM" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Please wake up, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-san</STYLE>, please wake up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
A young woman's voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\護送車内部.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="やまがき">Yamagaki</STYLE>-san was sitting there, looking at me out of the corner of her eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We'll be there in about 20 minutes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The bus was still moving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I seemed to have slept more deeply than I'd thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were probably already in Motoki City.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\20171011より\big-city1.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\元木町車窓.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From outside the bus came the <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="けんそう">bustle</STYLE> of cars and the city.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motoki City seemed to have become more urban than I'd imagined.<PG>
Come to think of it, going outside the walls and riding a bus was an event I'd never experience again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Falling asleep had been a waste. I'd have liked to enjoy the feeling of a trip a little longer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now―
{PAUSE ""}
could I escape right now? The joke floated into my head.<PG>
If I had that Droga, I might even be able to escape from here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu</STYLE> had said it: it was strictly a drug that takes off the brake the brain puts on to protect the body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Push it even a little, and the body falls apart in no time.<PG>
But if I did have Droga on hand right now, and used it, what would I do?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd strike these officers' vital points so they couldn't move, find the handcuff key, and run as far as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, before that, maybe I'd better take an officer's uniform.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Droga only lasts about 10 minutes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
